# Shattered Wings: "Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or creature with flying. Surveil 1." Bot1 destroys its own Memnite (the
# target is any artifact, whoever controls it), then surveils 1 and keeps the Forest on top: the library stays at 13.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Shattered Wings
Island x4
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Shattered Wings.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Forest | )

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = 
Bot1.Graveyard = Shattered Wings; Memnite; Black Lotus
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
